{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"hoe","model_identifier":"hoe","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## hoe\n\nWorker tool, hardwood + metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.5..2.5, y -7.0..0.9, z -41.0..3.0 (size 5.0 x 7.9 x 44.0 u = 14 x 22 x 124 cm).\nHoe, 1.2 m (44 u handle): flat blade at a right angle at the far end, pointing down (-Y). One geometry; texture per tier: hardwood blade (fire-hardened wood), copper, bronze, iron grades, steel. Grip (right hand) at the origin 3 u from the butt; handle runs forward (-Z) to the blade at 40 u. Two-handed: **second grip (left hand) 9 u (25 cm) forward along the handle** (z = -9), matching the worker / halfling farm_work clip.\n- Embedded texture: hardwood. Tier textures: hardwood, copper, bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_refined, steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `hoe_hardwood.png`, `hoe_copper.png`, `hoe_bronze.png`, `hoe_iron_bloom.png`, `hoe_iron_wrought.png`, `hoe_iron_refined.png`, `hoe_steel.png`, `hoe_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## hoe\n\nWorker tool, hardwood + metal tiers.\n\n- Cubes: 3 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.5..2.5, y -7.0..0.9, z -41.0..3.0 (size 5.0 x 7.9 x 44.0 u = 14 x 22 x 124 cm).\nHoe, 1.2 m (44 u handle): flat blade at a right angle at the far end, pointing down (-Y). One geometry; texture per tier: hardwood blade (fire-hardened wood), copper, bronze, iron grades, steel. Grip (right hand) at the origin 3 u from the butt; handle runs forward (-Z) to the blade at 40 u. Two-handed: **second grip (left hand) 9 u (25 cm) forward along the handle** (z = -9), matching the worker / halfling farm_work clip.\n- Embedded texture: hardwood. Tier textures: hardwood, copper, bronze, iron_bloom, iron_wrought, iron_re